# design-review: a design, for Alex to answer (a4039, 13 Oct). Since a5949 it is two lenses that already exist: stood on
# a document (in the home base's viewer, or scene design-review on <id>) it is that document's page, doc-page (its
# words, your call, the margin of comments and its Talk); opened on its own it is the Writing room, writing, whose rail
# holds the designs waiting for you. Residents read the one they review with doc-read and doc-answers, as before.
review : column
  share 1
  role page
  stood : column
    share 1
    only when ($item or "") != ""
    lens doc-page
  app : column
    share 1
    only when ($item or "") = ""
    lens writing
